{"case_id":"nb-dev-001","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Python 的列表推导式怎么写？如何在生成列表时加入筛选条件？","reference_answer":"列表推导式把循环写在方括号中，例如 [4*item for item in myList]；可以在末尾加入 if 条件筛选元素。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture1/Lecture1a.ipynb","section_path":["List Comprehension"],"cell_ids":["cell-119","cell-120","cell-121","cell-122"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","code","python"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-002","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"课件里如何用 pandas 读取 CSV、筛选 Age 大于 30 的行并计算平均年龄？","reference_answer":"使用 pd.read_csv 读取 CSV，通过 df[df.Age > 30] 筛选行，并用 df.Age.mean() 计算平均年龄。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture1/Lecture1a.ipynb","section_path":["pandas"],"cell_ids":["cell-170","cell-171","cell-172","cell-173","cell-174","cell-175","cell-176","cell-177","cell-178"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","code","table"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-003","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"NumPy broadcasting 如何从右侧匹配维度？什么情况下会报错？","reference_answer":"广播从最右侧维度开始匹配，并扩展大小为 1 的维度；如果对应维度既不相等也没有一方为 1，则无法广播并报错。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture1/Lecture1b.ipynb","section_path":["Broadcasting"],"cell_ids":["cell-71","cell-72","cell-73","cell-74","cell-75","cell-76","cell-77","cell-78","cell-79","cell-80","cell-81","cell-82"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","concept","numpy"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-004","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"NumPy 数组的普通赋值、view 和 deep copy 是否共享底层数据？","reference_answer":"普通赋值引用同一对象；view 是不同数组对象但共享底层数据；copy 会创建独立数据，修改副本不会影响原数组。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture1/Lecture1b.ipynb","section_path":["Copies and Views"],"cell_ids":["cell-109","cell-110","cell-111","cell-112","cell-113","cell-114","cell-115","cell-116","cell-117","cell-118","cell-119"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","comparison","numpy"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-005","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"一维高斯分布的均值和方差如何用最大似然估计？","reference_answer":"均值估计为样本均值，方差估计为样本相对估计均值的平方偏差之和除以样本数 N。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2a.ipynb","section_path":["MLE for Gaussian"],"cell_ids":["cell-26","cell-27","cell-28","cell-29"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","formula","mle"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-006","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"贝叶斯决策规则如何决定一个样本属于哪个类别？","reference_answer":"对给定观测 x，选择后验概率 p(y=c|x) 最大的类别；该规则使预测错误概率最小。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2a.ipynb","section_path":["Bayesian Decision Rule"],"cell_ids":["cell-32","cell-33"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","concept","bayes"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-007","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Bayes classifier 在训练阶段估计哪些量，分类新样本时又计算什么？","reference_answer":"训练时为每个类别估计类条件密度及其参数，并估计类别先验；分类时计算新样本对各类的似然和后验，选择后验最大的类别。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2a.ipynb","section_path":["Bayes Classifier Summary"],"cell_ids":["cell-48"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","workflow","bayes"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-008","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Gaussian Naive Bayes 对特征之间作了什么独立性假设？如果特征协同变化该怎么办？","reference_answer":"Gaussian Naive Bayes 假设给定类别后各特征独立。若特征存在协方差，应去掉该假设并用带完整协方差矩阵的多元高斯建模。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2b.ipynb","section_path":["Naive Bayes(NB) Assumption"],"cell_ids":["cell-32","cell-33","cell-34"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","concept","naive-bayes"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-009","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"把邮件文本转换成 Bag of Words 向量有哪些步骤？词表应该用训练集还是测试集建立？","reference_answer":"先统一大小写、移除停用词并建立词表，再统计每篇文档中词表词项的出现次数。词表只应由训练数据拟合，再用于转换训练集和测试集。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2b.ipynb","section_path":["Steps to make BoW"],"cell_ids":["cell-57","cell-58","cell-59","cell-60","cell-61"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","workflow","text"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-010","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"朴素贝叶斯里某个词在一个类别中从未出现会有什么问题？Laplace smoothing 怎么处理？","reference_answer":"零计数会让该词在该类中的估计概率为零，从而过度确定。Laplace smoothing 加入虚拟计数 alpha，例如 Bernoulli 情形使用 (N_j+alpha)/(N+2alpha)。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2b.ipynb","section_path":["Smoothing"],"cell_ids":["cell-79","cell-80","cell-81"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","formula","naive-bayes"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-011","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Multinomial Naive Bayes 如何对词频向量建模？pi_j,y 表示什么？","reference_answer":"它用多项分布作为类别条件分布，词频向量表示各词出现频率；pi_j,y 是词 w_j 在类别 y 中出现的概率，并且同一类别下所有词概率之和为 1。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture2/Lecture2b.ipynb","section_path":["Naive Bayes Multinomial"],"cell_ids":["cell-92","cell-93","cell-94"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","formula","naive-bayes"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-012","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Logistic regression 的参数如何从最大似然转化为 logistic loss 最小化？","reference_answer":"对 Bernoulli 后验最大化对数似然，利用 p(y|x)=sigma(yf(x))，可等价转为最小化所有样本的 log(1+exp(-y_i f(x_i)))。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture3/Lecture3a.ipynb","section_path":["Learning the parameters"],"cell_ids":["cell-37","cell-38","cell-39","cell-40","cell-41","cell-42","cell-43","cell-44","cell-45"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","derivation","logistic-regression"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-013","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Logistic regression 中 C 的大小如何影响 L2 正则强度和过拟合？","reference_answer":"目标中的正则项系数是 1/C，因此较小 C 带来更强惩罚并压低权重，通常更不易过拟合；较大 C 惩罚更弱，允许更大权重，也更可能过拟合。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture3/Lecture3a.ipynb","section_path":["Regularization"],"cell_ids":["cell-48","cell-49","cell-50"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","hyperparameter","logistic-regression"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-014","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"如何用 K 折交叉验证选择 logistic regression 的 C？选完以后为什么还要重新训练？","reference_answer":"在每个折分上尝试一组 C 并记录验证准确率，选择跨折平均准确率最高的 C；随后用选定 C 在全部训练数据上重新训练最终模型。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture3/Lecture3a.ipynb","section_path":["Cross-validation"],"cell_ids":["cell-67","cell-68","cell-69","cell-70"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","workflow","cross-validation"]}
{"case_id":"nb-dev-015","split":"dev","course_id":"CS5489","query":"普通最小二乘回归优化的目标是什么？课件给出的闭式解是什么？","reference_answer":"OLS 最小化训练集平方预测误差，即 ||y-X^T w||^2；课件给出的闭式解为 w*=(XX^T)^(-1)Xy。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture4/Lecture4a.ipynb","section_path":["Ordinary Least Squares (OLS)"],"cell_ids":["cell-18","cell-19","cell-20"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","formula","regression"]}
{"case_id":"nb-holdout-001","split":"holdout","course_id":"CS5489","query":"Ridge regression 为什么要在矩阵对角线上加入 alpha I？alpha 变大代表什么？","reference_answer":"alpha I 改善 XX^T 的条件性，使原本病态或不可逆的矩阵更容易求逆；alpha 越大，L2 惩罚和权重收缩越强，alpha=0 时退化为 OLS。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture4/Lecture4a.ipynb","section_path":["Ridge Regression"],"cell_ids":["cell-42","cell-43","cell-45","cell-46"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","formula","regression"]}
{"case_id":"nb-holdout-002","split":"holdout","course_id":"CS5489","query":"为什么 LASSO 能直接做特征选择，而 Ridge 通常只能缩小权重？","reference_answer":"LASSO 使用 L1 正则，能把接近零的权重直接推到零，因此得到稀疏权重并完成特征选择；Ridge 的 L2 正则主要连续缩小权重。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5489 Machine learning/Lecture4/Lecture4a.ipynb","section_path":["LASSO"],"cell_ids":["cell-63"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","comparison","regression"]}
{"case_id":"nb-holdout-003","split":"holdout","course_id":"CS5495","query":"局部代理模型解释黑盒预测时追求的 local fidelity 是什么意思？","reference_answer":"代理模型只需在待解释样本附近近似黑盒模型的决策函数，并在该局部区域保持高一致性，不要求全局都忠实。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5495 X AI/Lecture3/Lecture3a.ipynb","section_path":["Local Surrogate Models"],"cell_ids":["cell-41","cell-42"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","concept","xai"]}
{"case_id":"nb-holdout-004","split":"holdout","course_id":"CS5495","query":"LIME 从选定一个实例到给出解释的完整步骤是什么？","reference_answer":"选定实例，生成扰动样本并获取黑盒预测，按样本与原实例的接近程度加权，训练加权的可解释模型，最后通过该局部模型解释预测。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5495 X AI/Lecture3/Lecture3a.ipynb","section_path":["Mathematical Formulation","LIME Recipe"],"cell_ids":["cell-45","cell-46"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","workflow","xai"]}
{"case_id":"nb-holdout-005","split":"holdout","course_id":"CS5495","query":"LIME 如何为文本分类生成扰动样本，并衡量样本与原文本的接近程度？","reference_answer":"LIME 随机删除原文本中的词来生成扰动样本，用保留词的比例衡量接近程度，并把每个词表示为是否出现的二元特征。","expected_sources":[{"source_path":"CS5495 X AI/Lecture3/Lecture3a.ipynb","section_path":["LIME for Text"],"cell_ids":["cell-65"],"relevance":3}],"tags":["cross-lingual","text","xai"]}
